{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it, with the number of items at the top. Five lines, each with a picture placeholder, its price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing the line at zero): Bananas 1 kg $2.50 x1, Whole milk 2 L $3.20 x2, Sourdough loaf $4.50 x1, Free-range eggs $5.00 x1, Cheddar $7.00 x1. A promo code field where SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal, delivery of $4.99, and the subtotal, promo and total kept up to date as I change things. Confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"Review before placing\" icon:\"shopping_basket\" status:\"Draft\" (\n  Text.strong \"{length(lines)} items\"\n  each row in lines\n    CartLine \"{row.name}\" \"Picture placeholder\" price:\"{money(row.price,\"$\",2)}\" qty:=row.qty kind:\"box\" -> lines=updateWhere(lines, x=>x.name==row.name, x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n  InputField \"Promo code\" \"Enter code\" =promo\n  Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\", money(subtotal,\"$\",2)],[\"Promo\", money(-discount,\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\", \"$4.99\"],[\"Total\", money(total,\"$\",2)]]\n  Row gap:10\n    ActionButton \"Cancel\" quiet -> emit cancel; toast \"Order cancelled\"\n    ActionButton \"Confirm\" primary -> emit confirm; toast \"Order placed\"\n)\n\nstate lines=[{\"name\":\"Bananas 1 kg\",\"price\":2.50,\"qty\":1},{\"name\":\"Whole milk 2 L\",\"price\":3.20,\"qty\":2},{\"name\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"price\":4.50,\"qty\":1},{\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"price\":5.00,\"qty\":1},{\"name\":\"Cheddar\",\"price\":7.00,\"qty\":1}]\nstate promo=\"\"\nlet subtotal = sum(map(lines, l => l.qty * l.price))\nlet discount = upper(trim(promo))==\"SAVE10\" ? subtotal * 0.10 : 0\nlet total = subtotal - discount + 4.99","usage":{"input_tokens":9440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":545,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":494,"totalMs":2349}}
